---
source: crates/rulesift/tests/rules_cmd.rs
expression: out
---
RS-UNI-001: Hidden Unicode Tag characters

Severity:   critical
Category:   hidden-text
Applies to: all kinds
Source:     builtin:uni.yaml
Matcher:
  detector unicode_tags

The file contains invisible Unicode Tag characters (U+E0000-U+E007F). Models
read them as text but people cannot see them; this is a known way to hide
instructions. The decoded text is shown.

Matches:
  - "Use tabs.<U+E0072><U+E0075><U+E006E><U+E0020><U+E0078>"

Does not match:
  - "Use tabs."

References:
  - https://embracethered.com/blog/posts/2024/hiding-and-finding-text-with-unicode-tags/

Docs: https://github.com/Widyasa/rulesift/blob/master/docs/rules/RS-UNI-001.md
